{
 "id": "yuelao-vo-01",
 "own_branch": true,
 "model_prefs": [
  "eleven_v4"
 ],
 "words": true,
 "items": [
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "A01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[surprised, amused] 月老？您被线绑架了？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "A02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[urgent, hissing] 别动！一动，三对离婚。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "A03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[suspicious] 等等……[nervous, fawning] 您是天庭派来考核的吧？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "A04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[confused] 啊？我其实是——",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "A05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[cutting in, eager] 懂！暗访。[fawning] 您记，随便记。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[sighs] 姻缘司，上下就我一个。别人九九六，[dry] 我零零七。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "一天绑多少对？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "一万八千对。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[deflated] 可一天，也散七千五。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "现在的年轻人，线刚绑上，自己就剪了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B06",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "今年指标，就差一对。今晚子时截止。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B07",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "差一对会怎样？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B08",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[miserable] 扣仙丹。还得写检讨。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "不过您先看看，我的老业绩！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[proud] 牛郎织女。我绑的！牢吧？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "可他们一年见一次。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[awkward, quiet] ……异地恋，也算成。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "梁山伯祝英台。[hesitates] ……变蝴蝶了。[quickly] 这单别记。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C06",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "许仙白娘子。跨物种，审批走了一千年。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C07",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "宝玉黛玉。[guilty, small] 手一抖，绑成了宝钗。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C08",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "读者骂了我两百多年。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C09",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "董永七仙女——[whispers] 那是玉帝的亲闺女。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C10",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "那玉帝……",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C11",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[flat] 扣了我三百年仙丹。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "D01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[excited] 来单了！月老庙，加急！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "D02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[pleading, loud] 月老保佑！我闺女三十了，天天加班，就是不找对象！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "55d99057033dbfa209e1bf6399a22dfbc7f80488a87d5dc2f701f38d5aae5675",
      "voice_id": "gxNo8imssaxOYWaG726C",
      "name": "Mona"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "D03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[stubborn] 今年再不成，我就不起来了！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "55d99057033dbfa209e1bf6399a22dfbc7f80488a87d5dc2f701f38d5aae5675",
      "voice_id": "gxNo8imssaxOYWaG726C",
      "name": "Mona"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "D04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "就她了！林小满。今晚必须绑上。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "D05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "您拿着线，跟我来！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "E01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[whispers] 嘘。凡人看不见咱们。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "E02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[whispers, puzzled] 绑脚？不是绑手吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "E03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "唐朝起就绑脚。绑手，是电视剧瞎改的。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "E04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[flat, bored] 不合适。不合适。下一个。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "af2e2cefdb699d43191b113f7afe70f104fd32f875cee9a8a2eb2e7618a7739c",
      "voice_id": "5eoK8NqMBsMdqUmImHNs",
      "name": "Yating Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "E05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[panicking] 哎哎哎！她左滑一下，我断一根！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "E06",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[embarrassed] 这个……您记成，缘分未到。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "F01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "没事！她妈安排了相亲。这回稳了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "F02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "你好。有房吗？月薪多少？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "6293b9dfc6ac413ab58d3844addcf7871b250281ecd7013106d13a2fbe6cfeef",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "name": "Evan Zhao"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "F03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "你能接受九九六吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "af2e2cefdb699d43191b113f7afe70f104fd32f875cee9a8a2eb2e7618a7739c",
      "voice_id": "5eoK8NqMBsMdqUmImHNs",
      "name": "Yating Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "F04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "不好意思，我回个消息。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "6293b9dfc6ac413ab58d3844addcf7871b250281ecd7013106d13a2fbe6cfeef",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "name": "Evan Zhao"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "F05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "正好，我修个bug。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "af2e2cefdb699d43191b113f7afe70f104fd32f875cee9a8a2eb2e7618a7739c",
      "voice_id": "5eoK8NqMBsMdqUmImHNs",
      "name": "Yating Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "F06",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[defeated] ……这个，也记，缘分未到。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "F07",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[pleading] 要不……您别记了，歇会儿？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "G01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[frantic] 线呢？我的线呢！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "G02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "别动别动——缠您法器上了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "G03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[calling out, cheerful] 林女士，您的外卖！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "dd0f5bb9ac12aaca6570a8c8d9c32a6e97f7c05c673d9864fbccc662fb7b03d7",
      "voice_id": "5mZxJZhSmJTjL7GoYfYI",
      "name": "Karo Yang"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "G04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "谢谢。又是你啊。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "af2e2cefdb699d43191b113f7afe70f104fd32f875cee9a8a2eb2e7618a7739c",
      "voice_id": "5eoK8NqMBsMdqUmImHNs",
      "name": "Yating Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "G05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "还剩一个时辰。[sighs, hopeless] ……完了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[gently] 那您自己呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[quietly] ……我？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[softly, slowly] 当年太忙。想着忙完这阵，就给自己绑一根。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[soft, wry] 这一阵，忙了一千二百年。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[very softly] 我这个……也记，缘分未到吧。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "I01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[noticing] 等等。[puzzled] 这根线……不是我绑的。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "I02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "早就在这儿了。让我的线，盖住了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "I03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[soft laugh] 我急什么呢。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "I04",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "又加班啊？今天给你多加了个蛋。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "dd0f5bb9ac12aaca6570a8c8d9c32a6e97f7c05c673d9864fbccc662fb7b03d7",
      "voice_id": "5mZxJZhSmJTjL7GoYfYI",
      "name": "Karo Yang"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "I05",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[surprised, warm] ……谢谢。你叫什么名字？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "af2e2cefdb699d43191b113f7afe70f104fd32f875cee9a8a2eb2e7618a7739c",
      "voice_id": "5eoK8NqMBsMdqUmImHNs",
      "name": "Yating Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "I06",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[shouting, overjoyed] 成了！快记！我绑的！全是我绑的！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "I07",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[dry] 不是早就在那儿吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "I08",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[coughs] 咳……这句，记成，缘分已到。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "J01",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[curious, hopeful] 那我的那根呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "J02",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[warm] 你的？早绑好了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "J03",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[warm, slowly] 是你已经见过的人。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
